      <activity id="cd281f67-9304-5a88-a980-d3bdbd7580e9" activityNameId="468e7b35-1b2b-5caf-9414-29d6d94000ce" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Dolomite, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Dolomite, at plant
The functional unit represent 1 kg of milled dolomite. Large uncertainty of the process data due to weak data on the production process.;
CAS number: 016389-88-1; 
UUID: 633c6310-6b84-330b-bb26-e836f6eba2bd
Raw materials, machineries and energy consumption for production, estimated emissions to air from production and infrastructure of the site (approximation). No water emissions.
Location: Data are used here as European average.
Technology: Data approximated with data from lime mining, crushing and milling.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: approximation with data from literature 
Extrapolations: see technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_633c6310-6b84-330b-bb26-e836f6eba2bd.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
